xtreme (Figure 5D). As a case study, APPL2 -a putative T cell inactivator identified in our Jurkat analysis (Section 2.4) shows that X-Cell-Ultra accurately recapitulates the stimulated-state transcriptional signatures among both donor samples (Figure 5E), providing independent confirmation of the model's biological fidelity across experimental systems.",
